    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Omen-Thread Weaving.</strong> You tweak the probability-currents surrounding an action, giving it a subtle nudge toward success.</p><p><strong>Once per Soma Break</strong>, when you or an ally within 6 squares makes an Insight (Soul), Diplomacy (Presence), or Investigation (Mind) check, or attempts a Travel/Hex/Domain action, you may add <strong>+1d6</strong> to the roll after seeing it but before knowing the outcome.</p><p>If the action is a Faction or Domain action, you may also add <strong>+1 Soft Power</strong> or <strong>+10 Intrigue marks</strong> to that test. If it is a Travel action, you may ignore one minor hazard or reduce the marks cost by 10.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
